      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's super unsettling tho. like, i tried to tell myself it was just a coincidence, but it happens so consistently. if there's actually some kind of bio-electric thing going on, it feels like i'm losing control of it. do you think there are ways i can stabilize my energy or something? i don't want to keep causing disruptions or freaking people out at the office.",
